# Muldrotha's ruling (2020-11-10): "if you cast a creature spell from your graveyard, you can cast a card with bestow as an
# enchantment spell", and a permission lets the card be cast for an alternative cost of its own (CR 118.9, 601.3). Bestowed, the
# spell is an Aura enchantment spell and no creature spell (CR 702.103b), so Springheart Nantuko, milled by Thought Scour, may be
# cast bestowed through the enchantment way and not through the creature way. It enchants Llanowar Elves, a 2/2.

